{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object, check properties, take it, perform task, avoid obstacles or patrol area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleAhead    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = PatrolArea    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
